2026-10-15T13:09:14.5386895Z   WP-B: Unified Action and Scope Model
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5387292Z     1. Unified Action and Resource Policy Resolver (actionPolicyService)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5388014Z       ✓ Super Admin can manage any user and any lab (1 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5388510Z       ✓ Lab Manager can manage subordinate in own lab, but not in another lab (1 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5389006Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot manage peer manager or project manager
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5389440Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot elevate technician to manager role
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5390127Z       ✓ Self-role change is rejected with SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5390566Z       ✓ Inactive actor is denied with ACTOR_INACTIVE
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5390989Z     2. Project-to-Lab Canonical Membership Resolver (projectMembershipService)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5391589Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (3 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5392277Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (3 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5392972Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager (1 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5393753Z     3. Assignable Roles Server Catalogue (GET /api/access/assignable-roles)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5394303Z       ✓ Super Admin gets all 10 roles in assignableRoles (9 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5394990Z       ✓ Lab Manager gets only ALLOWED_SUB_ROLES and sees peer/admin roles as unmanageable with reasons (9 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5395695Z       ✓ Ordinary viewer is denied access to assignable-roles (403 Forbidden) (15 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5396305Z       ✓ GET /api/access/capabilities returns platform role capabilities (8 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5396738Z     4. Work Assignment Eligibility & Validation (A23, LG-17, A33)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5397350Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to deactivated technician is rejected with ASSIGNEE_INACTIVE (400) (34 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5397936Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to technician in different lab is rejected with 403 (7 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5398477Z       ✓ A23: Assignment in paused/inactive lab is rejected with LAB_PAUSED (400) (12 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5399167Z       ✓ GET /api/work/eligible-assignees returns active analytical staff and excludes deactivated staff (7 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5399738Z     5. Staff Directory Scoping & Bounded Pagination (LG-08, LG-22)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5400331Z       ✓ LG-08: National user directory is strictly scoped to labs in authorized country (6 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5401028Z       ✓ LG-08: National user with empty country scope receives empty array (not global leak) (4 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5401724Z       ✓ GET /api/users/directory?purpose=assignment filters to active analytical staff (5 ms)
2026-10-15T13:09:14.5402440Z       ✓ GET /api/users enforces bounded pagination (clamps excessive limit to 100) and excludes password (7 ms)
